  "faqTitle": "Common questions",
  "faq1q": "Is the bonus guaranteed?",
  "faq1a": "No. India Post declares bonus rates every year. Projections here assume the latest declared rate for every future year.",
  "faq2q": "Where do the premiums come from?",
  "faq2a": "From India Post's official premium tables. The app never estimates a premium.",
  "faq3q": "Is there an income tax benefit?",
  "faq3a": "Premiums may qualify under Section 80C (old tax regime) and maturity may be exempt under Section 10(10D), subject to conditions. This is not tax advice.",
  "faq4q": "Is GST charged on premiums?",
  "faq4a": "No. GST on individual life insurance premiums is nil from 22 September 2025.",
  "faq5q": "Who can buy PLI and RPLI?",
  "faq5a": "PLI: government and semi-government employees, professionals, graduates, diploma holders and others listed by India Post. RPLI: rural residents and scheduled bank savings account holders.",
